    {
      "id": 27,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "When something is wrong",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 49,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Search fails:** check Fly resources, then search traces. **Overlay lag grows:** inspect projection and ingest writes. **Snapshot ages:** inspect the Prefect build and R2 promotion. **Disk falls:** leave room for the next snapshot.\n\n[Logfire \u00b7 traces and ingest drops](https://logfire-us.pydantic.dev/waow/typeahead) \u00b7 [Prefect \u00b7 builds and enrichment](https://prefect-server.waow.tech) \u00b7 [Fly managed metrics](https://fly-metrics.net) \u00b7 [Typeahead stats](https://typeahead.waow.tech/stats)\n\n**Coverage:** endpoint probes run every minute. New probe history starts with this dashboard; Prometheus retains 7 days, Fly about 15 days. Identity counters do not prove the full firehose is caught up. Main ingest backlog/drop events, per-deployment Prefect outcomes, and Worker-specific error/cache rates still require the linked tools. No notification rules have been enabled."
      }
